  "description": "The Teammachine SLR ONE is built around a lightweight Advanced Carbon frame that lays the foundation of a bike born to defy gravity in a package that’s more accessible.\nRefined over more than a decade, this latest evolution of our segment-defining carbon road platform sets a new bar for stiffness-to-weight performance. Power transfer is immediate, handling is direct, and the bike remains composed when the road surface deteriorates. Ready to climb? This carbon road bike definitely is.\nAs the introduction to our flagship climbing bike range, it also carries the full suite of BMC design intelligence: TCC Race compliance construction, our signature D-shape carbon seatpost, and the unmistakable BMC ride feel that’s explosive when pushed, precise in the corners, and impressively smooth when the road turns rough. That feeling of acceleration? Earned.\nShimano Ultegra Di2 delivers crisp, consistent shifting and braking. AR 27 wheels maintain speed with minimal effort, while our ICS stem and alloy BMC handlebars complete a front end that is clean, stable, and easy to dial in.",
